# Tasks

**Chat name:** `Tasks`  
**Sidebar label:** Tasks  
**Agent starter:** `.cursor/agents/tasks.md`

## Sync contract

- Cloud (`app_settings.summit_tasks_bundle`) is source of truth. Device localStorage is a scratch pad.
- Never write the cache to cloud on boot. Last-write-wins by task/list `updatedAt` — a stale phone copy must not hide a newer save or resurrect a delete.
- Pull cloud when opening Tasks and when the app returns to the foreground. Pull-to-refresh is backup, not the only sync.
- Google pull stays authoritative for Google-linked tasks while connected. Same Connect / disconnect-all-devices as Calendar (`user_google_oauth`). UI label stays **Connected**. No Google branding in user-facing copy.

